<title>UK: Eurotunnel expects debt meeting July 10.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel expects debt meeting July 10.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel SA co-chairman Patrick Ponsolle said on Thursday he expected the Anglo-French tunnel operator to present its full debt restructuring package to shareholders and banks in mid-May.</p>
<p>Ponsolle told a news conference the shareholders' meeting needed to approve the restructuring would be initially scheduled for June 24 but for technical reasons it was likely to be held on July 10.</p>
</text>
